    <h1>UPDATE Oct 10th</h1>

    <p>
      On 24 August 2026 X&nbsp;Corp. sent cease and desist letters demanding a
      permanent takedown of Nitter instances and the project's repository. On
      8&nbsp;September 2026, they sent another, with the same demands and
      legal threats.
    </p>

    <p>
      My September 7th update said the project would continue with legal
      representation in place. That was based on assurances I received and
      believed, which have since turned out to be untrue. I apologize for the
      misleading information.
    </p>

